{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-condition--1","software--1","process--1","instance--761ccde3-2250-5593-9329-cf176c78aff1","software--2","instance--751f093b-6be4-5703-8f00-e394d77a30a2","software--3","instance--3536a568-610f-5570-bba9-6dfe97bc9c2e","instance--fe58d3c1-faa4-512f-a0c3-fa75b622e227","instance--ed6039fe-678b-5ae9-9576-73e6ea35b0c8","instance--b879673b-0c82-5a65-8ee4-4f18f90200fb","instance--bb170793-a0b8-5a22-b9f9-5dff26468abb","instance--f369065a-4305-5c0b-bf28-c38cb43b263d","instance--77eac446-2a0d-513a-8545-60472be63c55","instance--0e0aefbc-132c-5535-9d21-08a6439d6b20","instance--564e1cec-2b11-5a03-ae75-6413b06356d3","instance--477f512f-9970-5e9c-b5e8-e08afc5b8c09"],"properties":[["name","7777 Botnet \u2013 Insights into a Multi-Target Botnet"],["description","Bitsight research describing the 7777 botnet's compromise of network devices, installation of bind shells and SOCKS5 proxies, persistence limitations, and use of the botnet for low-volume brute force attacks on Microsoft 365 corporate accounts."],["scope","campaign"],["author",[["name","Sr. Threat Researcher (emeritus)"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","www.bitsight.com"],["url","https://www.bitsight.com/blog/7777-botnet-insights-multi-target-botnet"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Obtain remote code execution"],["description","After obtaining remote code execution on the devices, the threat actor installs a telnet binary that redirects connections to a bind shell that, after receiving the correct password, opens a new /bin/sh process."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1210"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Install telnet bind shell"],["description","After obtaining remote code execution on the devices, the threat actor installs a telnet binary that redirects connections to a bind shell that, after receiving the correct password, opens a new /bin/sh process."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1059.004"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Install SOCKS5 proxy server"],["description","In addition to the bind shell that allows the threat actor to maintain direct access to devices, a SOCKS5 server is also installed on the devices so that they can be used as proxies in future brute force attacks."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1090"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Brute force Microsoft 365 accounts"],["description","At the moment, the only certainty that exists is that the botnet is being used to attack corporate accounts of interest through brute force attacks on Microsoft 365 services, always at a very low volume, in order to maintain a low profile and avoid detection."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1110"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","All these artifacts installed on infected devices are placed within the /tmp directory which is volatile in memory. Whenever devices are turned off or restarted, their file system is reset and the contents of the /tmp directory are erased, which causes the threat actor to have to compromise the devices again."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--905f37ff-524a-522a-8685-08b6df9b34bd","120":"instance--a0b8bf42-8310-53d9-87f0-390378638ae9","150":"instance--ffafa2fa-6430-5714-9c5e-bbf977c9819b","180":"instance--10bf0e4d-ac4d-5742-b82b-398ef2467e2a","210":"instance--f2066b53-6fa4-5efa-8f61-dc81d3df5b0e","240":"instance--fbb6b151-c9f4-5cb6-b467-c563cc0c60d3","270":"instance--451ff5e8-5cc8-5d6c-b701-da17c04936f7","30":"instance--059bc992-da53-5d4b-ac82-60cfacc08e81","300":"instance--1d241382-a8ee-554a-aa3a-04366535b315","330":"instance--8a7078e9-787d-56b2-a734-f93cd76b3dc8","60":"instance--8aab1831-f6e3-582d-8f9b-3ad920a40e35","90":"instance--192458e5-76c8-5d8c-ab54-9ed8b36ef2bd"},"id":"software","instance":"software--1","properties":[["software_types",[["item-1","utility"]]],["display_name","telnet binary"],["name","telnet binary"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4e942bfd-4264-555c-8748-7eb2e999ff13","120":"instance--f044726d-ee55-52f4-88b4-fd39ff2b8e8d","150":"instance--14187d6c-2f13-51e8-bde1-91e065756a74","180":"instance--72fbf7a0-91d0-5e9f-b83b-7f5b189a8cef","210":"instance--e1937ddc-1102-52c0-9709-5f7600aba57e","240":"instance--a15e1468-8c2f-564d-98f3-27d39b4d492e","270":"instance--7f152962-47bb-5430-9fc9-64786b99deff","30":"instance--b1dba1f2